    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-bffe03609f@example.invalid",
    "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
    "text": "<p>Stryker (NYSE:SYK) announced that it will host a conference call on Tuesday, April 23, 2019 at 4:30 p.m., Eastern Time, to discuss the Company's operating results for the quarter ended March 31, 2019 and provide an operational update. Final operating results for the quarter ended March 31, 2019 will be released at 4:05 p.m. that day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2019/Stryker-to-host-conference-call-on-April-23-2019/default.aspx\">See full press release here</a>.</p>\n",
